* 05_codebook.do : Stata-side codebook of the harmonized file (plain text).
* The full codebook with sources, value maps and frequencies by survey is generated by code/R/05_codebook.R
* (docs/codebook.html|md); this step documents what the Stata build contains.
use "$DER/impd_public_v${VERTAG}_stata.dta", clear
capture log close cbk
log using "$DOCS/codebook_stata.txt", replace text name(cbk)
display "IMPD public component v$IMPD_VERSION - Stata build, `c(current_date)'"
describe
codebook, compact
log close cbk
display as text "Stata codebook written: docs/codebook_stata.txt"
